## Title: Magic Eraser
## Notes: Erase junk and free up bag space instantly. Completed quest items, low-level consumables, vendor-quality whites, and gray trash go with one click of the mini-map button, and anything sellable auto-sells at the merchant. Clean bags, automatically.
